# jump-line — шаги записи (что показывается — jump-line.md)
# Команды меняют только место каретки: `expect` держит, что текст не тронут, а место каретки
# проверяется кадрами. `#2` — второй `Continue past Separators` на вкладке (первый — у Move text). Разделители стартового набора — `||`.
open Jump in line.md
caret 1. #todo || call the plumber. Ask about Friday || 📅2026-10-06 @ call
say Default: Jump right hops word by word
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
caret 1. #todo || call the plumber. Ask about Friday || 📅2026-10-06 @  || 📅
say At the end of your text it wraps back to its start
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
say Jump left → it never steps into the tags
cmd move-cursor-left-in-line
cmd move-cursor-left-in-line
expect 1. #todo || call the plumber. Ask about Friday || 📅2026-10-06

say Step size → Sentence
settings Navigation
set Step size = Sentence
caret 1. #todo || call the plumber. Ask about Friday || 📅2026-10-06 @ call
say Jump right → to the end of each sentence
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
expect 1. #todo || call the plumber. Ask about Friday || 📅2026-10-06

say What to do at the end → Stop
settings Navigation
set What to do at the end = Stop
caret 1. #todo || call the plumber. Ask about Friday || 📅2026-10-06 @  || 📅
say Jump right at the end → the cursor stays put
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
cmd move-cursor-right-in-line
expect 1. #todo || call the plumber. Ask about Friday || 📅2026-10-06 / 2. book a table for two

say Continue past Separators → on
settings Navigation
set Continue past Separators #2 = on
caret 1. #todo || call the plumber. Ask about Friday || 📅2026-10-06 @ call
say Jump left → the cursor walks into the tags
cmd move-cursor-left-in-line
cmd move-cursor-left-in-line
expect 1. #todo || call the plumber. Ask about Friday || 📅2026-10-06
